    then activate 1 of these effects;\r\n\u25CF This card can attack an opponent's
    monster again in a row, and if it attacks a Defense Position monster, inflict
    piercing battle damage to your opponent.\r\n\u25CF Shuffle 1 card from your opponent's
    hand (at random) or their side of the field into the Deck, then this card gains
    100 ATK."
